    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but look at the math of it. i'm just a sinkhole for time and money and energy. he spends his best years fixing my mistakes or helping me walk, and i get nothing back to give him. it's not even about me being \"sad\" anymore, it's just that it's logical. if i just... stopped being an issue, he could finally move forward. wouldn't a person who loves you want you to see how much better they'd be without the burden of you?",
