      "content": "The logic you are using here is based on a distorted view of your value, which arises because you are trying to solve an overwhelming situation with your own thoughts rather than seeking support. It is important to recognize that your love, care, and resilience are not \"blurreys\" and that your husband's struggle often comes from helplessness at your condition rather than frustration with your existence. Please talk to a therapist who specializes in caregiver stress and chronic illness, as they can help you untangle these painful thoughts and reconnect you with the love and meaning you still hold for your marriage.",
